⋮----
// ── Layer 1: Agent Environment ───────────────────────────────────────────
⋮----
// ── Layer 2: Backend Infrastructure ─────────────────────────────────────
⋮----
/** WS-6 (audit plan): opts into the provisioner's script-agent install step (writing agent
